<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez sets CITIC call warrants.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez sets CITIC call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said it intended to issue 60 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$30.60	   PREMIUM	 9.75 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.891	   GEARING	 4.04X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	03.OCT.97	  PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	  BOARD LOT     10,000</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	HK$36.00</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
